---
import DocLayout from "../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
---

<DocLayout title="Compare" description="Tangled versus Nostr, AT Protocol, ActivityPub, Farcaster">
  <h1>Compare</h1>
  <p>
    Evidence-based. Full prose: <a href="/spec/comparison">Comparison chapter</a>.
    Tangled has no incumbent graph; that loss is listed, not hidden.
  </p>
  <h2 id="identity">Identity</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th></th>
        <th>Nostr</th>
        <th>AT Protocol</th>
        <th>ActivityPub</th>
        <th>Farcaster</th>
        <th>Tangled</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Primitive</td>
        <td>secp256k1 key</td>
        <td>DID (<code>did:plc</code> default)</td>
        <td>HTTPS actor URI</td>
        <td>On-chain FID</td>
        <td>Solana Ed25519, <code>did:sol</code> generative</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Rotation</td>
        <td>Not in NIP-01</td>
        <td>PLC log</td>
        <td>New URI</td>
        <td>Custody transfer</td>
        <td>Keys in <code>sys/id</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Cost to exist</td>
        <td>Free</td>
        <td>Free</td>
        <td>Free (operator)</td>
        <td>Gas + rent</td>
        <td>Free; rent only if persisting <code>did:sol</code> on-chain</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2 id="acl">Access control</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th></th>
        <th>Nostr</th>
        <th>AT Protocol</th>
        <th>ActivityPub</th>
        <th>Tangled</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Authorization</td>
        <td>Relay policy</td>
        <td>Public MST; permissioned-data is a second protocol, “access control, not confidentiality”</td>
        <td>Addressing, often ignored</td>
        <td>Capabilities on the same repo</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Confidentiality</td>
        <td>NIP-44 DMs</td>
        <td>Out of scope in 0016</td>
        <td>Not E2EE</td>
        <td><code>vis: sealed</code> + HPKE / MLS</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2 id="losses">Where Tangled is not better</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Network effects: none at spec time.</li>
    <li>No running network in this repository.</li>
    <li>Onboarding without keys is easier on ActivityPub. Custodial signing is optional and disclosed.</li>
    <li>Handles still lean on DNS or SNS.</li>
  </ul>
</DocLayout>
